<h2>References </h2>

<p class=3D"ref">Morrison, L. and Stephenson, F. R., "Historical Values of =
the Earth's Clock Error &#916;T and the Calculation of Eclipses", J. Hist. =
Astron., Vol. 35 Part 3, August 2004, No. 120, pp 327-336 (2004).</p>
<p class=3D"ref">Stephenson F.R and Houlden M.A., <em>Atlas of Historical E=
clipse Maps</em>, Cambridge Univ.Press., Cambridge, 1986.</p>

